      "additions": 8,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/.buildkite%2Fscripts%2Finstall-kv-connectors.sh",
      "changes": 9,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/.buildkite%2Fscripts%2Finstall-kv-connectors.sh?ref=93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": ".buildkite/scripts/install-kv-connectors.sh",
      "patch": "@@ -4,6 +4,13 @@\n \n set -euo pipefail\n \n+# do-not-merge: NIXL 1.5.0rc1.dev71137332 RC validation (CUDA only).\n+if python3 -c \"import torch; raise SystemExit(torch.version.cuda is None)\"; then\n+    uv pip install --system --no-deps --prerelease allow \\\n+        --no-index --find-links \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/index.html\" --require-hashes \\\n+        -r \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/nixl.txt\" -r \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/nixl-cu12.txt\" -r \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/nixl-cu13.txt\"\n+fi\n+\n if python3 -c \"import torch; raise SystemExit(0 if torch.version.hip is not None else 1)\"; then\n     uv pip install --system -r /vllm-workspace/requirements/kv_connectors_rocm.txt\n     exit 0\n@@ -47,7 +54,7 @@ MOONCAKE_VERSION=\"${MOONCAKE_VERSION:-}\"\n # nixl>=1.1.0 can install multiple CUDA wheel variants. Keep only the variant\n # matching this CI image so nixl_ep_cpp links against the available libcudart.\n uv pip uninstall --system nixl-cu12 nixl-cu13 2>/dev/null || true\n-uv pip install --system --no-deps \"nixl-cu${CUDA_MAJOR}==${NIXL_VERSION}\"\n+uv pip install --system --no-deps --prerelease allow --require-hashes --no-index --find-links \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/index.html\" -r \"https://github.com/svc-networking-sw/nixl-ver/releases/download/1.5.0rc1.dev71137332/nixl-cu${CUDA_MAJOR}.txt\"\n \n python3 - <<'PY'\n import importlib.metadata as metadata",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/.buildkite%2Fscripts%2Finstall-kv-connectors.sh",
      "sha": "36a42601622d100cf9aa07f86ebb00d939c4af43",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/requirements%2Fkv_connectors.txt",
      "changes": 2,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/requirements%2Fkv_connectors.txt?ref=93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "requirements/kv_connectors.txt",
      "patch": "@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ lmcache >= 0.3.9\n # CuPy 14.1.0 imports pytest from cupy.testing._random, which breaks runtime\n # images. 14.1.1 fixes the root cause, so only 14.1.0 is excluded.\n cupy-cuda13x != 14.1.0\n-nixl == 1.4.1\n+nixl == 1.5.0rc1.dev71137332 # do-not-merge: NIXL RC validation\n # CUDA 12 build. On the CUDA 13 image install-kv-connectors.sh swaps this for\n # the mooncake-transfer-engine-cuda13 variant of the same version.\n mooncake-transfer-engine >= 0.3.12",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/requirements%2Fkv_connectors.txt",
      "sha": "8eae5663cc335949c38f74d7a519ca6c5628a7f4",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/requirements%2Fkv_connectors_cu12.txt",
      "changes": 2,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/requirements%2Fkv_connectors_cu12.txt?ref=93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "requirements/kv_connectors_cu12.txt",
      "patch": "@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@\n # LMCache 0.5.x uses CUDA 13 dependencies; retain the CUDA 12 release here.\n lmcache == 0.4.4\n cupy-cuda12x != 14.1.0\n-nixl == 1.4.1\n+nixl == 1.5.0rc1.dev71137332 # do-not-merge: NIXL RC validation\n mooncake-transfer-engine >= 0.3.12",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/93c145bf114691e45207806cd751d7019d643a57/requirements%2Fkv_connectors_cu12.txt",
